      "content": "it's just hard to fight against that kind of reality, you know? like, people always say \"it gets better\" or \"make your mark,\" but how can you make a mark on a universe that's just going to expand and swallow everything anyway? every bit of struggle, every pain i feel right now... it feels like it's just noise. it’s just wasted energy in a vacuum. it feels like there's no real reason to keep fighting for a life that doesn't even matter in the grand scheme of things.",
